---
// Pôle Mère-Enfant & Sérénité Component
---

<section class="py-20 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto" id="mere-enfant">
  <div class="reveal-scale relative glass-card-elevated rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-14 overflow-hidden border border-[#c6f7ff] dark:border-cyan-900/40 shadow-xl">
    <div class="absolute -right-32 -bottom-32 w-96 h-96 bg-[#c6f7ff]/40 dark:bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none animate-pulse-glow"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full badge-cyan text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" data-icon="favorite">favorite</span>
          ACCOMPAGNEMENT DÉDIÉ
        </div>

        <h2 class="reveal stagger-1 font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white font-extrabold tracking-tight">
          Pôle Mère-Enfant : La sérénité dès les premiers battements de cœur.
        </h2>

        <p class="reveal stagger-2 font-body text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Nous avons repensé la naissance à Yopougon. Chambres individuelles baignées de lumière naturelle, suivi obstétrical continu, monitoring foetal sans fil et une équipe sage-femme disponible chaque seconde de votre séjour.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="reveal-scale stagger-3 flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm card-hover-effect group">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 text-[24px] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" data-icon="nest_cam_wired_stand">nest_cam_wired_stand</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-headline text-sm text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white font-bold">Suivi Néonatal Continu</div>
              <div class="font-body text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Surveillance pédiatrique post-partum immédiate</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal-scale stagger-4 flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm card-hover-effect group">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 text-[24px] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" data-icon="hotel">hotel</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-headline text-sm text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white font-bold">Suites Grand Confort</div>
              <div class="font-body text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Climatisation douce & accueil de l'accompagnant</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal stagger-5 pt-4">
          <a
            class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#c6f7ff] dark:bg-cyan-400 text-[#0A2540] dark:text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-[#b0f2fd] dark:hover:bg-cyan-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 border border-cyan-200 dark:border-cyan-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-cyan-300/40 group cursor-pointer focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400 focus-visible:outline-none"
            href="#portail"
            data-open-booking-modal
            data-specialty="Maternité"
          >
            <span>Planifier une visite de la maternité</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-200" data-icon="calendar_month">calendar_month</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Visual Showcase Card -->
      <div class="reveal stagger-3 lg:col-span-5 relative group">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light p-2 border border-[#c6f7ff] dark:border-cyan-900/40 shadow-xl">
          <img
            alt="Maternité moderne VANGA Medical"
            class="w-full h-[380px] object-cover rounded-2xl opacity-95 dark:opacity-85 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
            src="/images/maternite.jpg"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <!-- Floating Patient Review Chip with subtle floating animation -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#c6f7ff] dark:border-cyan-900/50 shadow-xl animate-float-slow">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-500 mb-1">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" data-icon="star" data-weight="fill">star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" data-icon="star" data-weight="fill">star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" data-icon="star" data-weight="fill">star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" data-icon="star" data-weight="fill">star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" data-icon="star" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#0A2540] dark:text-slate-200 italic leading-snug">
              « Une prise en charge d'un calme absolu pour la naissance de notre fille à Niangon. Les équipes sont d'une douceur rare. »
            </p>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Awa & Marc K. — Yopougon</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
